\citet{ruan2024failures} identify catastrophic actions as a distinct failure category; SafeRoute \citep{saferoute-2025} applies adaptive model selection for safety; Agent-SafetyBench \citep{agent-safetybench-2024} provides systematic evaluation of agent safety failures. \citet{bonagiri2025check} demonstrate that prompting agents to selectively quit high-risk situations yields safety improvements with negligible helpfulness loss; our framework diagnoses the mechanistic conditions under which such conservative routing dominates.

\paragraph{Causal Inference Grounding.}
Our episode-level labeling instantiates the potential outcomes framework~\citep{rubin1974estimating}: we treat routing mode as a binary intervention and compare outcomes under each pure strategy, analogous to average treatment effects under full compliance. Structural causal models~\citep{pearl2009causality} formalize the mechanism through which routing decisions affect episode outcomes; our DAF decomposition isolates the death-avoidance pathway within this causal structure.

